  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">R&#xe9;ponse humanitaire multisectorielle aux besoins des populations affect&#xe9;es par les conflits armes ZS de Kalehe-Sarcaf</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project to support people affected by the conflicts by preventing and responding to sexual and gender based violences.
While beneficiaries be receiving cash and agriculture assistance, this project will support those beneficiaries on preventives and responses to sexual and gender based violences.
10749 persons composed by men and women will be sensitized on preventives et responses against gender based violences and 200 women will get support for Income and generating activities.</narrative>
